  "prefLabel": "Frl 403.04 Waivers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 403.04 Waivers.\n\n(a) Any licensee with a serious illness, disability, hardship, or extenuating circumstances may request a waiver of Frl 403, in accordance with Plc 211, not less than 30 days prior to date of license expiration.\n\n(b) Applicants shall provide a plan for obtaining the required CE credits that includes the date that the applicant will complete the requirements.\n\n(c) Decisions on waiver requests shall be issued in accordance with Plc 211.08\n\nSource. #6516, eff 5-24-97, EXPIRED: 5-24-05\n\nNew. #9387, eff 2-12-09 (from Frl 403.08); ss by #12129, eff 3-10-17; ss by #14645, eff 9-7-26, EXPIRES: 9-7-36 (formerly Frl 403.06)",
